  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Jai Maa Ambey Udyog vs State Of U.P. And 3 Others on 8 August, 2019 Bench: Pankaj Mithal, Saral Srivastava High Court Of Judicature At Allahabad ? Court No. - 29 Case :- Writ - C No. - 24919 of 2019 Petitioner :- Jai Maa Ambey Udyog Respondent :- State Of U.P. And 3 Others Counsel for Petitioner :- Sanjeev Kumar,Vishal Agarwal Counsel for Respondent :- C.S.C. Hon'ble Pankaj Mithal,J. Hon'ble Saral Srivastava,J. Heard Sri Vishal Agarwal, learned counsel for the petitioner and learned Standing Counsel. The petitioner has preferred this petition for the quashing of the recovery citation dated 26.12.2018 for a sum of Rs. 1,55,000/-.",
    "facts": "The petitioner has preferred this petition for the quashing of the recovery citation dated 26.12.2018 for a sum of Rs. 1,55,000/-. The aforesaid recovery citation has been issued so as to recover the amount pursuant to the order dated 11.10.2018 passed by the competent authority under Food Safety and Standards Act, 2006. The petitioner has not challenged the aforesaid order.",
